{'symbol': 'BA', 'date': '2021-04-28 05:00:00', 'title': 'SILK WAY WEST AIRLINES ORDERS FIVE BOEING 777 FREIGHTERS', 'text': 'BAKU, AZERBAIJAN, APRIL 28, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- BOEING [NYSE:BA]\xa0AND SILK WAY WEST AIRLINES TODAY ANNOUNCED THE PRIVATE CARGO OPERATOR WILL EXPAND ITS INTERNATIONAL NETWORK WITH AN ORDER FOR FIVE 777 FREIGHTERS. THE DEAL MARKS THE FIRST PURCHASE OF THE LONG-RANGE, HIGH CAPACITY TWIN-ENGINE FREIGHTER IN THE CASPIAN REGION AND CENTRAL ASIA.'}